------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled third-party program: GoTree
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This product ships a compiled build of GoTree, embedded in the PhyloPanel
executable as `src-tauri/tools/gotree.exe` and unpacked at first launch.

    Project:   GoTree
    Upstream:  https://github.com/choishingwan/GoTree
    Version:   v0.5.2  (the binary is an unmodified build of that release;
               only the linker-injected version string was set, as upstream's
               own Makefile does)
    Author:    Hing Wan Chang and the GoTree contributors
    Licence:   GNU General Public License, version 2
               (full text reproduced at LICENSES/GPL-2.0.txt)

PhyloPanel is a separate program. It never links against, imports or embeds
GoTree source code: it starts GoTree as an independent child process and
exchanges data over standard input and standard output. The two programs
therefore remain separate and independently licensed works, and the Apache
License 2.0 above applies only to PhyloPanel's own sources.

GoTree's source code corresponding to the bundled binary is available from the
upstream repository above, at the tag named there. No restriction is imposed on
recipients of GoTree beyond the GNU GPL v2 under which upstream provides it.


